-- EduConnect seed data v0.2 – generated by server/scripts/generate-seed.js (do not edit by hand; edit the script).
-- Import once into a database created from educonnect_schema_v0.2.sql (needs MySQL 8.0.19+).
-- Everything runs in one transaction: if it fails half-way nothing is saved.
--
-- Every sample account uses the password: Educonnect@2026
-- Sign in with the username, email or phone. Emails use @educonnect.test (not real inboxes).
-- System Admin is NOT created here: use `npm run seed:admin` (shared DB already has "admin").
--
-- Accounts worth knowing:
--   binhnv     School Manager (Hiệu trưởng Nguyễn Văn Bình)
--   haltt      School Manager + Teacher (role switcher), teaches Toán 12D1
--   lannt      Teacher, homeroom of 10A1
--   maitt      Teacher, homeroom of 10D1
--   longhv     Teacher, homeroom of 11A1
--   anhptn     Teacher, homeroom of 11B1
--   tuanpm     Teacher, homeroom of 12A1
--   huongvt    Teacher, homeroom of 12D1
--   tuanpm     also Parent of baopg (10A1) – Teacher + Parent
--   hanttn     Parent with two children: khanglm (10A1), tramlnb (12A1)
--   nhuvtq     Student transferred from 10D1 to 10A1 on 05/10/2026
--   thanghd    Teacher with must_change_password = TRUE
--   dungnv     Student with must_change_password = TRUE
--   phucdd     Parent account LOCKED
--
-- ASSUMPTIONS (confirm with the team):
--   * Sample accounts have must_change_password = FALSE (except the two above) so developers can sign in directly.
--   * student_code = HS + entry year (2 digits) + 4-digit number; teacher_code = GV + 3 digits.
--   * Class type weights: focus subjects 2.00, others 1.00; focus subjects get one extra period per week.
--   * The homeroom teacher teaches HDTN of their class.
--   * Group members: GENERAL = homeroom + subject teachers + students + parents; STUDENT = homeroom + students;
--     PARENT = homeroom + parents; TEACHER_SCHOOL = all teachers + all School Managers.
--
-- Totals: 142 accounts (2 SM, 17 teachers incl. 1 SM, 48 students, 77 parents incl. 1 teacher), 6 classes.

SET NAMES utf8mb4;
USE educonnect;
START TRANSACTION;

